.===============================================================================
.TITLE{News}

.slide.font-size(4svh)

### Accepted
- spec: generic methods for Go [go.dev/issue/77273](https://go.dev/issue/77273)
  - allows defining methods on generic types, and using type parameters in method signatures
- spec: direct reference to embedded fields in struct literals [go.dev/issue/9859](https://go.dev/issue/9859)
    - allows struct literals to directly initialize fields of embedded structs without needing to specify the embedded struct's name
- runtime/pprof,runtime: new goroutine leak profile [go.dev/issue/74609](https://go.dev/issue/74609)
  -  change to the garbage collector that allows it detect some types of goroutine leaks (a.k.a. partial deadlocks in the academic community)

.===============================================================================
.TITLE{News}

.slide.font-size(4svh)

### Accepted
- crypto/mldsa: new package [go.dev/issue/77626](https://go.dev/issue/77626)
  - mldsa implements the post-quantum ML-DSA signature scheme specified in FIPS 204
- spec: type inferred composite literals [go.dev/issue/12854](https://go.dev/issue/12854)
  - allows composite literals to omit the type when it can be inferred from the context
- cmd/go: change `go mod init` default go directive back to 1.N [go.dev/issue/77653](https://go.dev/issue/77653)

.===============================================================================
